OL,3,GNEWSANo 'deliberate' contact to stop
OL,4,Acar in A66 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo evidence of "tactical contact" or
OL,7,Fthe use of a stinger has been found
OL,8,Fbefore the A66 crash which killed five
OL,9,Fyoung men and two police officers, an
OL,10,Finitial investigation has revealed.
OL,12,FThe crash between a Volkswagen Passat
OL,13,Fand a marked Cleveland Police vehicle
OL,14,Fhappened at South Bank, near
OL,15,FMiddlesbrough, on 22 August and
OL,16,Ffollowed a police pursuit which was
OL,17,Fabandoned.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
